  "result": "Perfect! Overdue report is complete. All 252 tests pass.\n\n**What was added:**\n\n1. **New src/reports.js** with `overdueInvoices(invoices, asOf)` function that:\n   - Filters for invoices with status 'issued' or 'partially_paid' (excludes draft and paid)\n   - Filters for invoices with dueDate strictly before asOf (not on or after)\n   - Requires both dueDate and invoice number to be present\n   - Returns array of overdue invoices sorted by daysOverdue descending (most overdue first)\n   - Each invoice object contains: `{ number, customerId, dueDate, daysOverdue, due }`\n   - Calculates:\n     - `daysOverdue` using `daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)`\n     - `due` using `balanceDue(invoice)`\n\n2. **20 comprehensive tests** covering:\n   - Empty invoice list and no matches\n   - Date boundary handling (on, before, after asOf)\n   - Status filtering (issued/partially_paid included, draft/paid excluded)\n   - DaysOverdue calculation (1 day, 77 days, across months/years)\n   - Due amount with partial payments\n   - Sorting by daysOverdue descending (most overdue first)\n   - Customer ID and invoice number inclusion\n   - Multiple invoices from same customer\n   - Invoices with discounts and VAT\n   - Cross-year invoices\n   - Various payment terms (NET14, NET30, EOM)\n   - Edge cases (missing dueDate, fully paid invoices)\n\nThe overdue report provides a sorted list of all invoices currently past their due date, helping track collection priorities based on how overdue each invoice is.",
